                                                "sense_id": "d6d22bbc-7d3d-30a1-a9ae-156d8d940146",
                                                "text": "The shortage of serviceable SR steam power has also led to the use of the surviving Q1 0-6-0s on passenger duties, particularly on the Horsham-Guildford service."
